# The home screen: walking along the row of fourteen tiles with the d-pad.
# Run: --boot off --fps 30 --frames 180
#
# With --boot off the home screen stands at frame 0, BENCH chosen.
# Each tap of right moves the choice one tile on; the row scrolls when the
# choice reaches the fourth place.

# 0-19: BENCH, still
# 20-44: right four times: CAMBER, DRIVE3D, HAIRPIN, KESTREL
20 press right
21 release right
28 press right
29 release right
36 press right
37 release right
44 press right
45 release right
# 45-63: rest on KESTREL
# 64-80: right three times: LANDER, LANTERN, MERCATOR
64 press right
65 release right
72 press right
73 release right
80 press right
81 release right
# 81-103: rest on MERCATOR
# 104-128: right four times: PADTEST, PROTO3D, ROOFTOP, SKIMMER
104 press right
105 release right
112 press right
113 release right
120 press right
121 release right
128 press right
129 release right
# 136-144: right twice: STARDUST, TUNDRA (the last tile)
136 press right
137 release right
144 press right
145 release right
# 145-179: rest on TUNDRA
#
# Stills: frame 10 (BENCH, the start of the row), 100 (MERCATOR, the middle),
# 132 (SKIMMER, near the end).
